# Changelog

All notable changes to the ${PLUGIN_NAME} Falco plugin will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]

## [${VERSION}] - YYYY-MM-DD

### Added

- Initial release of ${PLUGIN_NAME} Falco plugin
- Log parsing with security threat detection
- Support for ${LOG_FORMAT} log format
- 5-category security detection (SQLi, XSS, Path Traversal, Command Injection, Suspicious Agent)
- 3-layer E2E test architecture (Pattern, Pipeline, Falco Integration)
- macOS and Linux build support
- CI/CD workflows (CI, E2E, Release)
